WEBVTT

34:30.476 --> 34:32.686
-We'll be much safer in the cockpit.
-Yeah, bu...

34:33.312 --> 34:35.063
Buzz! Buzz!

34:35.148 --> 34:36.606
That's two lefts
and a right, huh?

34:36.691 --> 34:39.609
-Thanks for the directions, okay?
-Yeah. And remember, kid...

34:39.694 --> 34:41.111
Buzz!

34:53.583 --> 34:56.418
It's safer in the cockpit
than the cargo bay. What an idiot.
